## Architecture Review Board (ARB) Checklist

<div class="portal-checklist-box">
  <div class="portal-checklist-title">PR ARCHITECTURE CONFORMANCE CHECKLIST</div>
  <p>Verify that your implementation complies with enterprise standards before opening a pull request:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Clean Layer Separation:</strong> Presentation, Domain, and Data are organized into separate packages or Gradle/SPM/npm modules.</li>
    <li><strong>Dependency Direction:</strong> All dependencies point inward toward the Domain layer; Domain has zero dependencies on Data or Presentation.</li>
    <li><strong>Domain Unit Test Coverage:</strong> All Use Cases and business validation rules maintain at least 90% unit test coverage using mock repositories.</li>
    <li><strong>Circuit Breaker Protection:</strong> All external HTTP requests in repository implementations are wrapped in the enterprise Circuit Breaker.</li>
    <li><strong>Immutability:</strong> State models in ViewModels are exposed as read-only streams (<code>StateFlow</code> on Android, <code>@Published private(set)</code> on iOS, immutable React state).</li>
  </ul>
